The Truth Machine.

Romeo, a young man.
Juliet, a young woman.

Act I: The only act.
Scene I: The start.

[Enter Romeo and Juliet]

Juliet:
 You are as good as a flower.
 Am I as good as you?
 If so, let us proceed to scene II.
 Speak your mind!

[Exit Romeo]

Scene II: The output.

[Enter Romeo]

Juliet:
 Listen to your heart!
 Open your heart!
 You are as good as a flower.
 Am I as good as you?
 If so, let us proceed to scene II.
 Speak your mind!
 If not, let us proceed to scene III.

Scene III: The end.

[Exeunt]
